rent ways. \r\nSTATA Smart Door Lock Operate your home \r\nfrom any place around the world!! \r\n\r\nUnlock your door by \r\ni) Password \r\nii) RFID Card \r\niii) Fingerprint \r\niv) STATA Smart App \r\nv) Generate Guest OTP \r\nvi) Traditional Key.\r\n\r\n1 Year Free Replacement\r\n5 Years Service Warranty','upload/products/thumbnail/1774456760558883.webp','Buy Smart Door Lock - STATA X9 Plus','Buy our Highly Secured premium STATA X9 Plus Smart Door Lock. Keyless entry, 300 biometric fingerprint recognition & remote access control with StataLife App. Seamlessly integrates with smart home platforms. Elevate your security and convenience. Discover the STATA X9 Plus now!','https://www.youtube.com/embed/mbM9GVfAcpw',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2023-11-05 05:48:33','2023-11-05 05:48:33'),(49,19,16,'Smart Door Lock -STATA X9','STATA X9','ST-SDLX9','25','Locks','Regular','Black,Silver,Rose Gold','24999',NULL,'3749','STATA Smart App,Password,RFID Card,Generate Guest OTP,Traditional Key,Fingerprint','STATA Smart Door Locks are the security \r\nguards that you didn’t know you needed. \r\nStrong and Robust built with Aluminum and Zinc alloy, \r\nalways ready to protect your home. \r\nYou can unlock them in 6 different ways. \r\nSTATA Smart Door Lock Operate your home \r\nfrom any place around the world!! \r\n\r\nUnlock your door by \r\ni) Password \r\nii) RFID Card \r\niii) Fingerprint \r\niv) StataLife App \r\nv) Generate Guest OTP \r\nvi) Traditional Key.','upload/products/thumbnail/1775002904886554.webp','Smart Door Lock price in Bangladesh- STATA X9','Enhance your home security with the STATA X9 Smart Door Lock. Keyless entry, biometric fingerprint recognition, and remote access control. Seamlessly integrates with smart home platforms. Elevate your security and convenience. Discover the STATA X9 now!','https://www.youtube.com/embed/KdUNTpbHE04',1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-01-30 10:30:14','2024-01-30 10:30:14'),(50,19,17,'Smart Cleaning Robot Vacuum Cleaner','Robot Vacuum Cleaner','D960','0','cleaning-robot','Regular','White','27999',NULL,'3000','Humidification,Sweeping,Mopping,Vacuuming,Mechanical Operation Mode,USB Power Mode,Suction & Dragging Integrated,Intelligent Robot,Long Battery Life','𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐑𝐨𝐛𝐨𝐭 𝐕𝐚𝐜𝐮𝐮𝐦 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐞𝐫\r\n\r\nIn the fast-paced world of today, every minute counts. Keeping a clean and tidy home or office space is essential, but finding the time and energy for regular vacuuming can be a challenge. Enter the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner - a marvel of modern technology that revolutionizes the way we clean. This intelligent cleaning companion is designed to seamlessly navigate and clean your spaces, ensuring a pristine environment without the hassle.\r\n\r\n• 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐍𝐚𝐯𝐢𝐠𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠\r\nEquipped with advanced sensors and mapping technology, the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner effortlessly navigates through your space, mapping out the most efficient cleaning path. It avoids obstacles, maneuvers around furniture, and even tackles hard-to-reach spots, ensuring a thorough and comprehensive clean every time.\r\n\r\n•𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐞-𝐒𝐚𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲\r\nWith busy schedules, finding time for household chores can be daunting. The Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner is a time-saving solution that allows you to multitask while it take care of your cleaning. Simply set it to work, and it will autonomously clean your space, giving you valuable time to focus on other priorities.\r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐨𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐬\r\nTailor the cleaning schedule to fit your lifestyle. Whether you prefer daily touch-ups, weekly deep cleans, or specific cleaning times, the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner offers customizable scheduling options. This feature ensures that your space remains consistently clean and fresh, without any manual intervention.\r\n\r\n• 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐨𝐧 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐒𝐮𝐫𝐟𝐚𝐜𝐞𝐬\r\nFrom hardwood floors to carpets, the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner is designed to adapt to various surfaces. Its powerful suction and brush system effectively removes dirt, dust, and debris, leaving your floors spotless and allergen-free. It effortlessly transitions between surfaces, providing a thorough clean in every corner of your space.\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐇𝐨𝐦𝐞 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧\r\nThe Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner seamlessly integrates into your existing smart home ecosystem. Compatible with popular virtual assistants like Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant, it offers voice-activated control for added convenience. You can initiate cleaning sessions or schedule cleanings with simple voice commands.\r\n\r\n•𝐀𝐧𝐭𝐢-𝐅𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐀𝐧𝐭𝐢-𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐓𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐧𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐠𝐲\r\nSafety is a paramount concern, especially in multi-story homes or spaces with stairs. The Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner is equipped with anti-fall sensors that prevent it from tumbling down stairs or ledges. Additionally, its anti-collision technology ensures it navigates around obstacles without causing damage to furniture or walls.\r\n\r\n•𝐋𝐨𝐰 𝐌𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠\r\nDesigned for convenience, the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner requires minimal maintenance. Its dustbin is easy to empty, and the filter can be quickly cleaned or replaced. This means that maintaining your cleaning companion is as simple as the touch of a button.\r\n\r\nSmart Robot Vacuum Cleaner is more than just a cleaning device – it\'s a time-saving, intelligent companion that elevates your cleaning routine. With its advanced features and seamless integration into your smart home, it offers a hassle-free solution to maintaining a pristine environment. Embrace the future of cleaning with the Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner and enjoy a cleaner, more efficient space.\r\n\r\n𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐞𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n•Brand- Dibea\r\n•Model-D960\r\n•Working Mode: Auto, Spot, Edge, Daily Schedule\r\n•Self-Charging: Yes\r\n•Scheduled Reservation Function: Yes\r\n•Remote Control: Yes\r\n•Using Time: 120 – 150 minutes\r\n•Charging Time: About 4 – 5 hours\r\n•Suction: 1200 Pa\r\n•Dust tank Capacity: 350ml\r\n•Water Tank: 350ml\r\n•Noise: Less than 55dB\r\n•Application Area: 150-200㎡\r\n•Adapter Input: 100 – 240V 50 / 60Hz\r\n•Adapter Output: 26V 450mA\r\n•Voltage: 14.8V\r\n•Power: 30W\r\n•Lithium-ion battery capacity: 2600mAh\r\n•Lithium-ion battery output voltage: 26.5V\r\n•Power adapter: EU plug & US plug\r\n•Package size (L x W x H): 60.00 x 42.00 x 14.00 cm / 23.62 x 16.54 x 5.51 inches\r\n•Package weight: About 12.90 pounds\r\n\r\n𝐏𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐈𝐧𝐜𝐥𝐮𝐝𝐞𝐝:𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n➨1 x Dibea D960 Smart Robot Vacuum Cleaner\r\n➨2 x Side Brush\r\n➨1 x Cleaning Brush\r\n➨1 x Mop Cloth\r\n➨1 x Changing Base\r\n➨1 x Remote Control\r\n➨1 x Power Adapter\r\n➨1 x English User Manual','upload/products/thumbnail/1774474855632461.webp','Robot Vacuum Cleaner Price in Bangladesh - Stata IT Limited','Effortlessly clean your floors with a Robot Vacuum Cleaner. Smart mapping, automatic navigation, and powerful suction. Enjoy more free time and a cleaner home. Discover the convenience of a Robot Vacuum Cleaner today.','https://www.youtube.com/embed/skh7dKg2pmo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-11-05 07:01:35','2023-11-05 07:01:35'),(51,19,15,'Smart Home Economy Package','STATA Economy Package','Economy Package','2','Switch','Regular','Black,White,Gold','4700',NULL,'701','Smart Home Package,Discount Offer,2 Gang Smart Switch,1 Gang Smart Switch,5 Years Warranty','STATA Smart Home\r\nPackage Name: Economy Package\r\nOriginal Price: 4,700/-\r\nBundle Price: 3,999/-\r\n\r\nWhat’s in the package :\r\n1) Smart Wifi Touch Switch (2 Gang) *1\r\n2) Smart Wifi Touch Switch (1 Gang) *1\r\n\r\nNumber of devices: 2\r\n\r\nFree Replacement For 365 Days\r\n5 Years Service Warranty\r\n24/7 Customer Support','upload/products/thumbnail/1775451483895347.webp','STATA Economy Package- Smart Home Automation','Buy STATA Economy Package with combo set of 1 Gang & 2 Gang of Smart Wi-Fi Touch Switch. This offer comes with 1 year free replacement & 5 years service warranty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-01-30 10:28:18','2024-01-30 10:28:18'),(52,19,15,'3 Pin Smart S