d monitor your door from anywhere in the world. Whether you\'re on a business trip or simply relaxing in the backyard, your home\'s security is always at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nPassword: For those who prefer the digital age with a touch of tradition, the Clutch offers a customizable password. It\'s like having a secret handshake with your door.\r\n\r\nRFID Card: Slip your card and enter. Simple, swift, and secure. The RFID card is your express lane to home.\r\n\r\nGenerate Guest OTP: For unexpected visitors, the Clutch offers a one-time password (OTP) solution. Grant access without compromising security.\r\n\r\nTraditional Key: In the rare event of technological hiccups, the Clutch doesn\'t leave you stranded. A traditional key is always there, a steadfast companion.\r\n\r\nFingerprint: Biometric security at its finest. Your fingerprint, a unique identifier, becomes your key to unlocking convenience.\r\n\r\nBeyond Security\r\nThe STATA Clutch isn\'t just about keeping intruders out; Picture yourself carrying a sack full of groceries when you get home. A simple touch of your fingerprint, and the door swings open. Or perhaps you\'re expecting guests and want to ensure their safe entry. Generate an OTP, and they can access your home with peace of mind.\r\n\r\nDurability Meets Design\r\nThe Clutch is made to last because it is composed of premium ABS plastic. Its robust construction ensures it remains a steadfast guardian, protecting your home from the elements and potential threats. But durability doesn\'t mean sacrificing aesthetics. The Clutch is designed with a sleek, modern look that complements any home decor.\r\n\r\nA Smart Investment\r\nInvesting in the STATA Clutch is more than buying a door lock; it\'s an investment in peace of mind. It\'s about protecting your refuge, your family, and your possessions. With its multiple unlocking options, advanced technology, and robust construction, the Clutch is more than a product; it\'s a lifestyle upgrade.\r\nExperience the future of home security. Experience the STATA Clutch.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nRobust ABS plastic construction\r\n\r\nSix unlocking methods: Unlock your door by \r\ni) Password \r\nii) RFID Card \r\niii) Fingerprint \r\niv) STATA Smart App \r\nv) Generate Guest OTP \r\nvi) Traditional Key.\r\n\r\nAdvanced security features\r\n\r\nSleek, modern design\r\n\r\nEasy installation and use\r\n\r\nWarranty-\r\n1-Year Free Replacement\r\n5 Years Service Warranty','upload/products/thumbnail/1775010950400314.webp','Wifi Smart Door lock price in Bangladesh- STATA Clutch','Enhance your home security with the Wifi Smart Door Lock - Stata Clutch. Keyless entry, RFID Card, remote access control from StataLife App, and Guest OTP for your smart home system. Experience peace of mind with Stata Clutch.','https://www.youtube.com/embed/DgfFOLbwK_U',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-07-29 05:33:20','2024-07-29 05:33:20'),(60,19,18,'LED Hexagoan light (STATA Hex)','STATA HEX','ST-HEX','0','rgb-light','Regular','Black,White,Gold','5199',NULL,'5200','16 million color,Sync with Music,Dimmer Mode,StataLife App Support,6x light,USB Cable,Schedule Time','𝐋𝐄𝐃 𝐇𝐞𝐱𝐚𝐠𝐨𝐧(𝐇𝐄𝐗) 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬 (𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐇𝐄𝐗): 𝐈𝐥𝐥𝐮𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐭𝐲𝐥𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲\r\nDo you want to decorate your home, office or studio with a modern touch of elegance? Our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights offer the perfect blend of style and efficiency, creating a visually stunning effect that elevates any room\'s ambiance. With their hexagonal shape, these lights not only provide a unique and captivating look but also optimize the use of natural light, promoting energy efficiency.\r\n\r\n𝐔𝐧𝐢𝐪𝐮𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧: The hexagonal shape of our LED lights creates a visually appealing pattern that adds a contemporary and sophisticated touch to your space. Whether used as standalone pieces or in clusters, they become a statement piece in any room.\r\n\r\n𝐕𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬: Our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights come in various options, such as warm white, cool white, and color-changing RGB. Choose the lighting tone that complements your interior and sets the desired mood.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲-𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭: With advanced LED technology, our lights are highly energy-efficient, consuming less power while producing bright and long-lasting illumination. Save electricity bills with high-quality lighting.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐇𝐨𝐦𝐞 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: For tech-savvy individuals, our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights can be integrated with smart home systems, allowing you to control and adjust lighting remotely. Embrace the convenience of modern smart lighting.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Designed for hassle-free installation, our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights can be mounted on walls or ceilings with ease. Create your desired lighting arrangement effortlessly.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: The compact and space-saving design of our LED lights allows you to use them in any room, regardless of size. Illuminate even the smallest corners with style.\r\n\r\n𝐖𝐢𝐝𝐞 𝐑𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬: From living rooms and bedrooms to offices and commercial spaces, our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights find StataLife applications, adding a touch of elegance and modernity to any environment.\r\n\r\nTransform your space with the captivating glow of our LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights. Embrace a modern and energy-efficient lighting solution that complements your style and enhances the overall ambiance. Experience the future of lighting with our versatile and aesthetically pleasing LED Hexagon(HEX) Lights. Illuminate your space with style and efficiency today.\r\n\r\n𝐏𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐞: 5200/-\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐇𝐄𝐗 𝐅𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞𝐬:\r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐫: 16 Million Color Option\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐲𝐧𝐜𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Sync With Music\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞: Schedule Time\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐜𝐞𝐧𝐞: Pre-Set Scene\r\n\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞: Dimmer Mode\r\n\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐩𝐩: Controlled using StataLife App from any place at any time around the world\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞: Amazon Alexa & Google Home Compatible\r\n\r\n•𝐖𝐡𝐚𝐭\'𝐬 𝐈𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐛𝐨𝐱:\r\n⇨6x lights\r\n⇨6x PCB connector board\r\n⇨10x Corner connector\r\n⇨8x Double-sided tapes\r\n⇨1x STATA manual\r\n⇨1x Plastic stand\r\n⇨1x 1.5M USB cable\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 & 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲-\r\n1-Year Free Replacement\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐨𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐂𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭-\r\n24/7 Customer Care\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐍𝐨𝐰: 09678200509, 01720514565\r\n𝐅𝐨𝐫 𝐃𝐞𝐚𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐡𝐢𝐩: 01312735557','upload/products/thumbnail/1774924521860286.webp','LED Hexagon(HEX) lights Price in Bangladesh','Illuminate your space with the captivating glow of LED Hexagon (HEX) lights. Create a visually stunning effect with their unique hexagonal shape. Perfect for accent lighting and creating a statement piece. Enhance your space with LED Hexagon lights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2024-02-07 10:08:33','2024-02-07 10:08:33'),(61,19,15,'Smart Fan Dimmer - STATA','STATA Smart Fan Dimmer','ST-SFS','18','Switch','Regular','Black,White','2900',NULL,'290','App Control,Touch,Scheduling,Remotely Control','𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐅𝐚𝐧 𝐃𝐢𝐦𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐒𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 - 𝐄𝐥𝐞𝐯𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥\r\nAre you tired of traditional on/off switches for your ceiling fans? Upgrade your fan control experience with Smart Fan Dimmer Switches. These innovative devices bring a new level of convenience and versatility to your home, allowing you to adjust fan speed and even dim the lights all in one place. At STATA IT LIMITED, we offer a wide range of Smart Fan Dimmer Switches at competitive prices in Bangladesh, making it easier than ever to enhance your living spaces.\r\n\r\n𝐊𝐞𝐲 𝐅𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞𝐬:\r\n𝐅𝐚𝐧 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐞𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥: With Smart Fan Dimmer Switches, you have complete control over your fan\'s speed. Say goodbye to manually adjusting pull chains or using multiple switches – now, everything is at your fingertips.\r\n\r\n𝐃𝐢𝐦𝐦𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠: Many of our Smart Fan Dimmer Switches come with dimmable lighting options, allowing you to set the perfect ambiance in any room. Create a cozy atmosphere or brighten up your space effortlessly.\r\n\r\n𝐖𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐑𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐭𝐞 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐬𝐬: Forgot to turn off the fan before leaving home? Not a problem! With wireless remote access, you can control your fan and lights from anywhere using your smartphone with our user-friendly StataLife App.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐇𝐨𝐦𝐞 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Our Smart Fan Dimmer Switches are designed to seamlessly integrate with popular smart home ecosystems like Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant. Enjoy hands-free voice control for ultimate convenience.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲: Reduce energy consumption and utility bills with smart scheduling features. Set timers to automatically turn off fans and lights when not needed, promoting eco-friendly practices.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Installing Smart Fan Dimmer Switches is a breeze with our user-friendly instructions. No need to hire a professional – transform your home in minutes.\r\n\r\n𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞: Our Smart Fan Dimmer Switches are built to last, offering reliable performance for years to come. Rest assured that your investment is backed by top-notch quality.\r\n\r\n𝐀𝐟𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐝𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐞𝐬 𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐥𝐚𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐡: We understand the importance of affordability. That\'s why we offer competitive prices for our Smart Fan Dimmer Switches, ensuring everyone can experience the benefits of smart living.\r\n\r\nTransform your living spaces with the latest smart technology. Upgrade to Smart Fan Dimmer Switches today and enjoy enhanced comfort, convenience, and energy efficiency. Discover the best prices in Bangladesh at stataglobal.com and embark on a journey towards a smarter home.\r\n\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥: STATA Smart Fan Dimmer\r\n•𝐏𝐚𝐧𝐞𝐥: Crystal glass panel, no fading\r\n•𝐖𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐨𝐟: Yes\r\n•𝐀𝐧𝐭𝐢-𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐠: Yes\r\n•𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐝: You can set a timer for this device\r\n•𝐕𝐨𝐥𝐭𝐚𝐠𝐞: 170V-240V \r\n•𝐋𝐨𝐚𝐝 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫: 5-300W/Gang \r\n•𝐂𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: CE, FCC, RoHS\r\n•𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞: -20-70 Degree\r\n\r\n𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲 & 𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞-\r\n1 Year Free Replacement & 5 Years Service Warranty','upload/products/thumbnail/1781159270500346.webp','STATA Smart Fan Dimmer Switch (Wi-Fi Mobile App Control)','Enhance your fan control with the STATA Smart Fan Dimmer Switch. Adjust fan speed from a single switch with Voice control and smartphone app(StataLife)','https://www.youtube.com/embed/0HenG8pXARM',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2024-01-30 10:28:38','2024-05-20 05:09:35'),(63,19,15,'Smart Boiler Switch - STATA','STATA Smart Boiler Switch','ST-SBS','55','Switch','Regular','Black,White','3000',NULL,'301','STATA Smart App,Touch control,Remotely control,Scheduling','𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐁𝐨𝐢𝐥𝐞𝐫 𝐒𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐜𝐡\r\nTake control of your Water heating with the STATA Smart Boiler Switch. This Wi-Fi enabled device allows you to conveniently manage and schedule your boiler remotely, ensuring comfort and energy efficiency. With its easy installation and compatibility with popular smart home platforms, you can easily integrate it into your existing smart home ecosystem. Experience the convenience of adjusting your boiler settings from anywhere and optimize your energy usage with the STATA Smart Boiler Switch.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n•𝐈𝐭𝐞𝐦 𝐓𝐲𝐩𝐞: Wi-Fi Smart Switch\r\n•𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐥: Abs + Tempered Glass\r\n•𝐏𝐧𝐚𝐞𝐥: Crystal glass panel, no fading, elegant and stylish \r\nIntegrated panel design, waterproof and anti-creeping\r\n•𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥 𝐒𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦: Smooth Touch control ensures longer service life  than mechanical switch New imported IC processor for nice sensitivity and stable performance Humanized  design\r\n•𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐝: Remotely scheduled & you can set a timer for these smart devices.\r\n•𝐑𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐕𝐨𝐥𝐭𝐚𝐠𝐞: 170V-240V \r\n•𝐋𝐨𝐚𝐝 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫: 5-300W/Gang \r\n•𝐖𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐲𝐩𝐞: Wireless 2.4Ghz\r\n•𝐖𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐝: Ieee 802.11 B/G/N\r\n•𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞: Google Assistance and Amazon Alexa\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐩𝐩: StataLife\r\n•𝐂𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: CE, FCC, RoHS\r\n•𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞: -20-70 Degree\r\n\r\n•𝐏𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐚𝐠𝐞𝐬:   \r\n⇨1X Stata Smart Boiler Switch\r\n⇨1x User Manual\r\n⇨ 2x Screw\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 & 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲:\r\n1 Year Free Replacement & 5 Years Service Warranty\r\n\r\n**𝐊𝐞𝐲 𝐅𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞𝐬:**\r\n\r\n**𝟏. 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥:\r\nElevate your home heating experience effortlessly! The STATA Smart Boiler Switch empowers you to remotely manage your boiler using your smartphone or tablet, guaranteeing your home is consistently cozy, regardless of location. Say hello to optimal comfort and convenience!\r\n\r\n**𝟐. 𝐄𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲:\r\nEliminate wasted energy and reduce high utility bills. Our Smart Boiler Switch optimizes your heating schedule. Considering your daily habits, we can find ways to reduce energy use and keep costs low. We are saving you money without sacrificing comfort.\r\n\r\n**𝟑. 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐮𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠:\r\nCustomize your heating schedule to perfectly fit your lifestyle! With our user-friendly app, you can effortlessly program specific heating times and temperatures for each day of the week. Enjoy the comfort of a warm home whenever you need it!\r\n\r\n**𝟒. 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nSeamlessly integrate the STATA Smart Boiler Switch with your existing smart home ecosystem. Compatible with popular smart home assistants like Alexa and Google Home, you can control your boiler with simple voice commands or integrate it into your home automation routines.\r\n\r\n**𝟓. 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐥-𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠:\r\nKeep track of your boiler\'s performance in real-time and stay in the know! Enjoy instant notifications for any issues or maintenance needs, guaranteeing your heating system\'s top-notch efficiency and safety.\r\n\r\n**𝟔. 𝐔𝐬𝐞𝐫-𝐅𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐥𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐟𝐚𝐜𝐞:\r\nOur Smart Boiler Switch features a sleek, user-friendly interface that makes controlling your boiler a breeze. The easy-to-navigate app provides a seamless experience, whether you\'re a tech enthusiast or a first-time smart home user.\r\n\r\n**𝟕. 𝐄𝐧𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐒𝐚𝐟𝐞𝐭𝐲:\r\nSafety is our top priority. The STATA Smart Boiler Switch includes built-in safety features such as automatic shut-off and system diagnostics, providing extra protection for your home and family.\r\n\r\n**𝟖. 𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nDesigned for hassle-free installation, the STATA Smart Boiler Switch can be easily set up without professional assistance. Our comprehensive installation guide and customer support team are always available to help.\r\n\r\n**𝟗. 𝐄𝐥𝐞𝐠𝐚𝐧𝐭 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧:\r\nComplement your home\'s aesthetic with the modern and sleek design of the STATA Smart Boiler Switch. Its compact form blends seamlessly with your home decor while delivering powerful functionality.\r\n\r\n**𝟏𝟎. 𝐄𝐜𝐨-𝐅𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐥𝐲:\r\nJoin the movement towards a greener planet. The STATA Smart Boiler Switch helps reduce your carbon footprint by optimizing your home\'s heating efficiency, contributing to a more sustainable future.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your home heating system with the STATA Smart Boiler Switch and experience the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and energy efficiency. Discover the future of home heating today','upload/products/thumbnail/1815538213704589.png','STATA Smart Boiler Switch price in Bangladesh- Stata It Limited','Manage and schedule your water heating with ease using the STATA Smart Boiler Switch. Wi-Fi enabled for remote control and compatibility with popular smart home platforms. Stay comfortable and energy-efficient. Buy now!','https://www.youtube.com/embed/hxFS2A6XlVQ',1,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2024-06-09 05:24:39','2024-11-12 17:22:45'),(64,19,18,'Smart Strip Light- STATA','STATA Smart Strip Light','ST-RGB Strip','19','rgb-light','Regular','RGB','3300',NULL,'330','STATA Smart App,16 million color,Scheduling,Voice Control','𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐩 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬: 𝐀 𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐟𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐁𝐥𝐞𝐧𝐝 𝐨𝐟 𝐒𝐭𝐲𝐥𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐅𝐮𝐧𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲\r\nIn the ever-evolving landscape of home decor, lighting plays a pivotal role in creating ambiance and functionality. The STATA Smart Strip Light stands as a beacon of innovation, seamlessly merging style with smart technology. This cutting-edge lighting solution offers a plethora of features that redefine the way we illuminate our living spaces.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐥𝐞𝐞𝐤 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐞𝐬\r\nThe STATA Smart Strip Light boasts a sleek, modern design that effortlessly complements any interior decor. Its slim profile and flexible form factor allow for versatile installation, making it an ideal choice for both residential and commercial spaces. Whether it\'s accentuating architectural elements or providing task lighting in the kitchen, this strip light effortlessly blends into any environment.\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐨𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐦𝐛𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐚𝐭 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐩𝐬\r\nOne of the standout features of the STATA Smart Strip Light is its ability to create personalized lighting atmospheres. Through an intuitive mobile app, users can fine-tune the color temperature and brightness and even program dynamic lighting effects. Whether you\'re looking for warm, cozy lighting for a relaxed evening or vibrant, energizing hues for a lively gathering, the possibilities are endless.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐬𝐭 𝐒𝐚𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬\r\nIn an era where energy conservation is paramount, the STATA Smart Strip Light shines bright in terms of efficiency. Built with energy-saving LED technology, it consumes significantly less power compared to traditional lighting solutions. This not only lowers electricity bills but also reduces your carbon footprint, aligning with eco-conscious living.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐄𝐜𝐨𝐬𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦𝐬\r\nThe STATA Smart Strip Light is designed to be a seamless part of your connected home. It integrates effortlessly with popular smart ecosystems such as Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, and Apple HomeKit. This means you can control your lighting with simple voice commands or incorporate it into your existing automation routines, providing a truly connected living experience.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐧𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞\r\nBeyond its aesthetic appeal, the STATA Smart Strip Light also enhances the security and convenience of your space. With features like motion sensing and scheduling, you can set up lighting profiles that mimic your presence even when you\'re away. This not only deters potential intruders but also adds a layer of convenience to your daily routine.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐋𝐨𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐯𝐢𝐭𝐲\r\nSetting up the STATA Smart Strip Light is a breeze, thanks to its user-friendly installation process. The durable construction ensures that it stands the test of time, providing reliable illumination for years to come. With a lifespan that far exceeds traditional bulbs, you can enjoy hassle-free lighting without the need for frequent replacements.\r\n\r\nSTATA Smart Strip Light represents a leap forward in the realm of smart lighting solutions. Its blend of stylish design, customizable ambiance, energy efficiency, and seamless integration into smart ecosystems make it a standout choice for modern living spaces. Elevate your lighting experience with the STATA Smart Strip Light and transform your space into a haven of style, comfort, and functionality. Illuminate your world, the smart way.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n•𝐋𝐞𝐧𝐠𝐭𝐡: 5M Strip light, \r\n•𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭: LED\r\n•𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐫 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞: RGB\r\n•𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐫: 16 Million Color Option\r\n•𝐒𝐲𝐧𝐜𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Sync with Music \r\n•𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠: Support Schedule Time, Pre-Set Scene\r\n•𝐃𝐢𝐦𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞: Enable \r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐩𝐩: Controlled Using StataLife App From\r\nany Place At Any Time Around The World \r\n•𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞: Amazon Alexa & Google Home Compatible.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 & 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲\r\n1-Year Free Replacement','upload/products/thumbnail/1775002350103582.webp','STATA Smart RGB LED Strip Light 5M (Wi-Fi) Enable','Enhance your space with the STATA Smart RGB LED Strip Light 5M. Create stunning visual effects, adjust colors, and sync with music. Elevate your home decor and lighting experience. Buy now!','https://www.youtube.com/embed/NARuqgxPhtc',1,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2024-01-30 10:29:13','2024-02-04 06:24:04'),(65,19,14,'STATA Capsule- Smart 350 degree CCTV camera','STATA Capsule','ST-CAP-IP','3','ip-camera','Regular','White','3300',NULL,'330','STATA Smart App,350 Degree,Two Way Communication,HD Camera,Motion Detection,SD Card Supported','𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐂𝐚𝐩𝐬𝐮𝐥𝐞- 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝟑𝟓𝟎 𝐝𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐂𝐂𝐓𝐕 𝐜𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐚\r\nEnhance your security system with the STATA Capsule - Smart 350-degree CCTV camera. This innovative camera provides comprehensive coverage with its 350-degree panoramic view, ensuring no blind spots in your surveillance. With its advanced features like motion detection, night vision, and two-way audio, you can monitor your property in real-time and communicate remotely. Easy to install and compatible with popular smart home platforms, the STATA Capsule offers peace of mind and top-notch security for your home or business.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n•𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞: Auto Smart Tracking \r\n\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐩𝐩: Supports StataLife App\r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐚 𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐨𝐥𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: 1080P HD & SMART PAN/TILT/ZOOM\r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐚 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞: Intelligent Mobile Tracking Recognition \r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐖𝐚𝐲: TWO-WAY AUDIO \r\n\r\n•𝐖𝐢-𝐅𝐢 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Easy Set-up with 2.4G Wi-Fi\r\n\r\n•𝐂𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐚 𝐅𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞: HD Day & Night Monitoring\r\n\r\n•𝐌𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐃𝐞𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Sensitive Motion Detection\r\n\r\n•𝐒𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐚𝐠𝐞: Supports both Cloud & Memory Card (upto128 GB)\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 & 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲\r\n1-Year Free Replacement','upload/products/thumbnail/1775002668030402.webp','STATA Capsule- Smart 350 degree CCTV camera','Ensure comprehensive security with the STATA Capsule - Smart 360 degree CCTV camera. Easy installation and compatibility with smart home platforms. Elevate your security system today.','https://www.youtube.com/embed/8J4uKWzDoqE',1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-01-30 10:29:04','2024-02-04 06:40:20'),(66,19,14,'Smart Gas Sensor (With Valve)- STATA','STATA Smart Gas Sensor (With Valve)','(ST-WGS-VL)','0','sensor','Regular','White','11999',NULL,'12000','STATA Smart App,Remotely control,Voice Control,Scheduling','𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐀 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐆𝐚𝐬 𝐒𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐨𝐫 (𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐕𝐚𝐥𝐯𝐞) 𝐆𝐄𝐓 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐭 𝐍𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 !! \r\n\r\nIn the fast-evolving landscape of modern technology, it\'s crucial for businesses to prioritize safety and efficiency. The STATA Smart Gas Sensor, equipped with a cutting-edge valve, emerges as a game-changer in the realm of gas monitoring systems. This innovative device combines precision, reliability, and intelligent automation to ensure a seamless gas management experience for both residential and commercial settings.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐚𝐟𝐞𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐇𝐨𝐦𝐞𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐁𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐞𝐬:\r\nSafety is paramount when it comes to handling gas in any environment. The STATA Smart Gas Sensor stands as a vigilant guardian, continuously monitoring gas levels and promptly detecting any anomalies. Its advanced sensor technology provides real-time data, allowing for quick response and preventing potential hazards. With its integrated valve, the system takes safety a step further by automatically shutting off the gas supply in case of a significant deviation from normal levels.\r\n\r\n𝐔𝐧𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐦𝐢𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nAccuracy is the cornerstone of effective gas monitoring. The STATA Smart Gas Sensor employs state-of-the-art sensing mechanisms that deliver unparalleled precision in measuring gas concentrations. This high level of accuracy ensures early detection of even the slightest deviations, providing a crucial advantage in preventing gas-related incidents. Its intelligent algorithms analyze data in real time, providing accurate feedback for timely action.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐔𝐬𝐞𝐫-𝐅𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐥𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐟𝐚𝐜𝐞:\r\nIntegration into existing gas systems is effortless, thanks to the user-friendly design of the STATA Smart Gas Sensor. Its compatibility with various platforms and protocols ensures a hassle-free installation process, minimizing downtime for businesses. The intuitive interface empowers users with easy access to critical information, making it a valuable asset for both homeowners and businesses seeking to optimize their gas management strategies.\r\n\r\n𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐁𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬:\r\nFor businesses, efficiency is not just a goal, but a necessity. The STATA Smart Gas Sensor contributes significantly to operational efficiency by automating gas supply adjustments. The integrated valve responds instantly to sensor data, allowing for precise control over gas flow. This level of automation reduces manual intervention, streamlines operations, and ultimately leads to cost savings.\r\n\r\n𝐂