er of security, obstructing the view from outside and deterring potential intruders.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐌𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞:\r\nThe film is easy to clean and maintain, requiring minimal effort to keep it looking pristine and functional for years to come.\r\n\r\n𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐟𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nOur expert team ensures a seamless and precise installation process, guaranteeing optimal performance and longevity.\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐚𝐟𝐞𝐭𝐲 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬:\r\nThe Smart PDLC Film - Switchable Smart Glass meets industry-specific safety standards, providing peace of mind regarding its quality and performance.\r\n\r\nSmart PDLC Film - Switchable Smart Glass represents a leap forward in intelligent design and functionality. It will transform spaces, enhance privacy, and improve energy efficiency making it a valuable addition to any environment. Elevate your space with this innovative technology and experience a new level of control and sophistication. Embrace the future with Smart PDLC Film - Switchable Smart Glass.\r\n\r\nThe price given is per square meter, The Price is 8400 taka/ Square Meter','upload/products/thumbnail/1795383104376399.webp','Smart PDLC Film - Switchable Smart Glass -STATA IT LIMITED','Discover the versatility of Smart PDLC Film-Switchable Smart Glass. Enjoy instant privacy, energy savings, and seamless integration. Elevate your space with this innovative technology.','https://www.youtube.com/embed/sRQy6ZReGec',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,1,'2023-11-13 07:08:13','2024-04-04 06:05:54'),(103,19,15,'Fan Regulator Imperial Series','Fan Dimmer Imperial Series','STIM-ZBIT-TGS-FAN','1000','Switch','Regular','White','785','550',NULL,'Fan Dimmer,Copper,Made of Poly carbonate Virgin Resin,All screws are made of copper','Experience unparalleled control of your indoor environment with the STATA Imperial Fan Dimmer. Crafted to complement modern interiors while offering exceptional performance, this fan dimmer makes a stylish yet practical addition to any room demanding style and functionality.\r\n\r