 to aesthetics.\r\n\r\n𝗪𝗵𝘆 𝗰𝗵𝗼𝗼𝘀𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗧𝗔 𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗮𝗹 𝗙𝗮𝗻 𝗗𝗶𝗺𝗺𝗲𝗿?\r\n\r\nPrecision: You can find your ideal fan speed with finely tuned adjustments.\r\n- Aesthetic Appeal: Enhance any room\'s aesthetics with its modern design. Ease of Use: Easy Installation and user-friendly controls simplify life, while energy Savings help lower electricity bills significantly.\r\n- Enjoy quiet operation for an uncluttered environment with this fan. Durability: Premium construction ensures long-term use. Versatility: Compatible with various ceiling fans for use and configuration options.\r\n\r\nEnhance both comfort and control with the STATA Imperial Fan Dimmer. From creating a cozy living room ambiance and maintaining ideal temperatures in bedrooms or offices to increasing air circulation - this fan dimmer has you covered! So invest now for maximum fan control efficiency.','upload/products/thumbnail/1795386992530655.webp','STATA Fan Dimmer Imperial Series: Lowest Price in Bangladesh','Experience unparalleled comfort and energy savings with STATA\'s Imperial Series fan dimmers. Enjoy the lowest prices in Bangladesh.',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 07:33:14','2024-11-05 07:33:14'),(104,19,15,'1 Gang 1 Way Switch Imperial Series','1 Gang 1 Way Imperial Series','STIM-ZBIT-TOS-1G','100','Switch','Regular','White','210','147',NULL,'Made of Poly carbonate Virgin Resin.,Fire Retardant.,All screws & Connectors are made of copper','STATA Imperial Series \r\n\r\nIntroducing the STATA 1 Gang 1 Way Imperial Switch Series – where simplicity meets efficiency. Designed for those who appreciate straightforward functionality, this non-smart switch offers a single gang control for seamless operation. With a modern design, durability, and compatibility with standard electrical systems, it\'s the epitome of reliable simplicity. Elevate your space with the understated elegance of the STATA 1 Gang 1 Way Imperial Switch Series, redefining the essence of non-smart switch convenience.\r\n\r\nSpecification