erials, it ensures longevity and reliable performance. This commitment to durability makes it a wise investment for both residential and commercial applications.\r\n\r\nEffortless Operation with 1-Way Functionality:\r\nSimplicity meets efficiency with the 1 Way functionality of the Imperial Switch Series. The intuitive design ensures effortless operation, allowing users to easily control their lighting or other electrical fixtures with a single switch. This user-friendly feature makes it suitable for users of all ages.\r\n\r\nCompatibility with Standard Electrical Systems:\r\nThe Imperial Switch Series is engineered to seamlessly integrate with standard electrical systems. Supporting a voltage of 250V AC and a current of 13A aligns with industry standards, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of electrical infrastructures.\r\n\r\nFire-Retardant Properties for Enhanced Safety:\r\nSafety is paramount, and the Imperial Switch Series prioritizes it with fire-retardant properties. This switch is designed to resist and inhibit the spread of fire, adding an extra layer of safety to your electrical systems.\r\n\r\nSTATA 2 Gang 1 Way Imperial Switch Series encapsulates a perfect blend of elegance, versatility, and durability. From its modern design to 2 Gang functionality, seamless smart home integration, and safety features, this series is poised to transform your electrical experience. Upgrade your space with the Imperial Switch Series and witness the convergence of style and innovation.\r\n\r\nSpecification:\r\nInternational Standards\r\nDurable\r\nEfficient\r\nElegant Design\r\nGenerator Friendly\r\nVoltage: 250V AC\r\nCurrent: 13A\r\nFrequency: 50/60Hz','upload/products/thumbnail/1795562138220502.webp','Buy 2 Gang STATA imperial Switch- 1 Way','STATA offer 2 Gang Switch- 1 way at Lowest Price in Bangladesh. 10% Discount on First Purchase.',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 07:32:52','2024-11-05 07:32:52'),(106,19,15,'3 Gang 1 Way Switch Imperial Series','3 Gang 1 Way Imperial Series','STIM-ZBIT-TGS-3G','1122','Switch','Regular','White','340','240',NULL,'Made of Poly carbonate Virgin Resin.,Fire Retardant.,All screws are made of copper','STATA Imperial Series 3 Gang Switch\r\n\r\nElevate your electrical switch experience with the STATA 3 Gang 1 Way Imperial Series, a testament to cutting-edge design and unwavering quality. Crafted with precision and engineered for optimal performance, this switch stands out in terms of its unique features that cater to safety, durability, and seamless functionality.\r\n\r\nMade of Polycarbonate Virgin Resin:\r\nAt the heart of the Imperial Series switch lies the use of polycarbonate virgin resin. This premium material enhances the switch\'s durability and ensures a polished finish. The switch\'s robust construction with virgin resin guarantees long-lasting performance, making it a wise investment for both homes and businesses.\r\n\r\nFire Retardant:\r\nSafety is paramount, and the Imperial Series switch prioritizes it with its fire-retardant properties. The switch is designed to resist and inhibit the spread of fire, providing an added layer of security for your electrical infrastructure. This feature underscores STATA\'s commitment to safeguarding both lives and property.\r\n\r\nAll Screws Made of Copper:\r\nIn a testament to the attention to detail, every screw on the Imperial Series switch is crafted from copper. Known for its excellent conductivity and corrosion resistance, copper ensures reliable electrical connections and longevity. This meticulous choice of material contributes to the overall efficiency and reliability of the switch.\r\n\r\n3 Gang Switch:\r\nThe Imperial Series is not just a single switch; it\'s a versatile 3 Gang Switch. This means you can control three different electrical circuits with one compact and stylish unit. This feature enhances convenience and simplifies the management of multiple electrical connections in your space.\r\n\r\nVoltage: 250V AC:\r\nOperating seamlessly at a voltage of 250V AC, the Imperial Series switch is designed to meet the demands of various electrical systems. This versatility makes it a suitable choice for both residential and commercial applications, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of electrical infrastructures.\r\n\r\nCurrent: 13A, Frequency: 50/60Hz:\r\nThe Imperial Series switch is engineered to handle a current of 13A, making it robust enough to accommodate various electrical loads. Operating within a frequency range of 50/60Hz, the switch aligns with global standards, ensuring optimal performance across different electrical grids.\r\n\r\nSTATA 3 Gang 1 Way Imperial Series stands as a beacon of innovation and reliability in the realm of electrical switches. From its use of high-quality virgin resin to fire-retardant properties, copper screws, versatile 3 Gang functionality, and compatibility with diverse voltage and frequency requirements, this switch is a symbol of excellence in both form and function. Upgrade your space with the Imperial Series and experience the pinnacle of switch technology.\r\n\r\nSpecification:\r\nInternational Standards\r\nDurable\r\nEfficient\r\nElegant Design\r\nGenerator Friendly\r\nVoltage: 250V AC\r\nCurrent: 13A\r\nFrequency: 50/60Hz','upload/products/thumbnail/1787326259523583.png','Buy 3 Gang STATA Imperial Switch- 1 Way','STATA offer 3 Gang Switch- 1 way at Lowest Price in Bangladesh. 10% Discount on First Purchase.',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 07:31:53','2024-11-05 07:31:53'),(107,19,15,'4 Gang 1 way Switch Imperial Series','4 Gang 1 way Imperial Series','STIM-ZBIT-TGS-4G','1234','Switch','Regular','White','390','270',NULL,'Made of Poly carbonate Virgin Resin.,Fire Retardant.,All screws are made of copper','STATA Imperial Series\r\n\r\nDiscover the excellence in switch design with the STATA 4 Gang 1 Way Switch Imperial Series. This exceptional switch not only adheres to international standards but also boasts a range of features that set it apart in