rious electrical loads. Additionally, it operates seamlessly within a frequency range of 50/60Hz, ensuring compatibility with different electrical grids.\r\n\r\nSTATA 4 Gang 1 Way Switch Imperial Series is a pinnacle of excellence in switch design. From adhering to international standards and ensuring durability to boasting an elegant design and accommodating diverse electrical scenarios, this switch redefines electrical control with style and efficiency. Upgrade your space with the Imperial Series and experience the perfect fusion of form and function.','upload/products/thumbnail/1801358055590157.png','Buy 4 Gang STATA Imperial Switch- 1 Way','STATA offer 4 Gang Switch- 1 way at Lowest Price in Bangladesh. 10% Discount on First Purchase.',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 07:31:12','2024-11-05 07:31:12'),(108,19,16,'STATA ACE','STATA ACE','ST-LOK-SDL-ACE-BL','1','Locks','Regular','Black','10999',NULL,'0','STATA Smart App,Password,RFID Card,Generate Guest OTP,Traditional Key','STATA ACE Smart Door Lock: Your Home\'s Unyielding Guardian\r\nSecurity, Redefined\r\n\r\nIn a world increasingly concerned with safety and convenience, the STATA ACE Smart Door Lock stands as a testament to both. Engineered with meticulous attention to detail, this lock is more than just a security measure; it\'s a fortress of tranquility for your home.\r\n\r\nA Foundation of Strength\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the STATA ACE lies its robust construction. Crafted from high-strength aluminum alloy, this lock is built to endure. Its unwavering resilience is not just a claim but a promise of protection against potential threats. The sleek design, available in classic black, timeless bronze, elegant silver, and pristine white, seamlessly integrates into any architectural style without compromising on security.\r\n\r\nUncompromising Security\r\n\r\nBeyond its aesthetic appeal, the STATA ACE boasts a Level C lock cylinder, a benchmark in security. This advanced mechanism offers unparalleled resistance against tampering and unauthorized entry, providing you with peace of mind.\r\n\r\nConvenience at Your Fingertips\r\n\r\nUnlock a world of convenience with the STATA ACE\'s versatile unlocking options. Whether it\'s the quick and secure fingerprint recognition, the familiar ease of a password, the practicality of a swipe card, the traditional reliability of a key, or the flexibility of a temporary password for guests, this lock caters to every preference.\r\n\r\nEnduring Performance\r\n\r\nDesigned to withstand the test of time, the STATA ACE operates flawlessly within a temperature range of 20°C to 60°C, ensuring consistent performance across diverse climates. Powered by four readily available No. 5 batteries, this lock offers reliable operation, complemented by a micro USB emergency power supply for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nAdaptability and Precision\r\n\r\nWith a boundary dimension of 70X185MM, the STATA ACE is meticulously designed to seamlessly fit doors with thicknesses ranging from 40MM to 120MM. This versatility ensures compatibility with a wide range of door types, making it a suitable choice for homes, offices, or commercial establishments.\r\n\r\nBeyond Security\r\n\r\nThe STATA ACE is more than just a lock; it\'s a statement of your commitment to safety and sophistication. Its sleek design, coupled with its robust construction and advanced features, elevates your home\'s security to new heights.\r\n\r\nExperience the Difference\r\n\r\nInvest in a lock that doesn\'t merely protect your home but enhances your lifestyle. The STATA ACE is not just a product; it\'s a guardian, a symbol of your commitment to safety, and a testament to your discerning taste.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nHigh-strength aluminum alloy construction\r\nLevel C lock cylinder\r\nMultiple unlocking options (fingerprint, password, swipe card, key, temporary password)\r\nLong-lasting battery life with micro USB emergency power supply\r\nWide operating temperature range (20°C - 60°C)\r\nCompatible with door thicknesses from 40MM to 120MM\r\nSleek design available in black, bronze, silver, and white\r\nElevate your home\'s security with the STATA ACE Smart Door Lock - where strength meets sophistication.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecification-\r\nProduct name: STATA ACE smart lock\r\nMain material: high-strength aluminum alloy\r\nProduct color: black bronze silver white\r\nLock cylinder level: Level C\r\nBattery capacity: 4 No. 5 batteries\r\nEmergency power supply: Micro USB\r\nPower supply voltage: 7.4V\r\nWorking temperature: 20 ℃~60 ℃\r\nApplicable door thickness: 40MM-120MM\r\nBoundary dimension: 70X185MM\r\nUnlock mode: Fingerprint unlock, Password unlock, Swipe card unlock, Key unlock, Temporary password','upload/products/thumbnail/1815768895174286.jpg','STATA ACE Smart Door Lock: Best Price in Bangladesh','Secure your home with the STATA ACE Smart Door Lock, now available at the lowest price in Bangladesh. Enjoy advanced security features, including fingerprint recognition and mobile app control, for unparalleled peace of mind.',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-07-27 05:20:13','2024-11-15 06:29:20'),(109,19,16,'STATA GAZE','STATA GAZE','ST-LOK-SDL-GAZ-DF','1','Locks','Regular','Black','52999',NULL,'0','STATA Smart App,Password,RFID Card,Generate Guest OTP,Traditional Key,face recognition,Night vision camera','In the age of smart living, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock emerges as a beacon of advanced security, seamlessly blending cutting-edge technology with user-friendly features. Let\'s delve into the top seven features that make STATA GAZE the epitome of intelligent door access.\r\n\r\nSTATA Smart App:\r\nThe STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock introduces unparalleled control through the STATA Smart App. Users can effortlessly manage and monitor door access remotely, receive real-time notifications, and grant or restrict access with a simple tap on their smartphones. This intuitive app ensures convenience and peace of mind, putting security at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nPassword Protection:\r\nEnhancing traditional security measures, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock offers a password feature. Users can set secure and personalized passwords, providing an additional layer of protection against unauthorized access. This feature ensures that only individuals with the designated password can gain entry.\r\n\r\nRFID Card Access:\r\nFor those who prefer a card-based system, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock incorporates RFID card access. Users can effortlessly swipe or tap their RFID cards for quick and secure entry. This feature is not only convenient but also offers a contactless solution for modern security needs.\r\n\r\nGenerate Guest OTP:\r\nCatering to the needs of hospitality and shared living spaces, STATA GAZE introduces the ability to generate one-time passwords (OTPs) for guests. Hosts can grant temporary access by providing guests with unique OTPs, ensuring controlled entry without the need for physical keys.\r\n\r\nTraditional Key Option:\r\nIn acknowledgment of diverse user preferences, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock includes a traditional key option. This serves as a fail-safe method, providing access using a physical key in situations where electronic methods may not be suitable or available.\r\n\r\nFace Recognition Technology:\r\nAt the forefront of biometric security, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock features advanced face recognition technology. This innovative feature enables seamless and secure access by scanning and verifying the user\'s face, adding an extra layer of personalized security to your door.\r\n\r\nNight Vision Camera:\r\nEnsuring security around the clock, the STATA GAZE Smart Door Lock is equipped with a night vision camera. This feature enhances visibility in low-light conditions, providing clear and detailed images for added security during the nighttime.\r\n\r\nSTATA GAZE Smart Door Lock encompasses a comprehensive array of features, redefining door access in the realm of smart living. From the convenience of