ower Output: With its robust power output and multiple sockets for simultaneous charging of devices, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket can quickly charge multiple devices without compromising speed or efficacy - perfect for offices and households that rely on regular device charges. This feature makes the socket an essential asset when multiple devices require regular powering up.\r\n\r\nDesign and Build\r\n**Ergonomic Design: A socket\'s design should consider aesthetics as well as functionality. An ergonomic layout ensures all ports can be reached easily, even when multiple devices are plugged in simultaneously.\r\n\r\n**Robust Construction: Our exterior components are built using top-grade fireproof materials that withstand extreme temperatures to help minimize risks and keep us safe. Internal components are similarly reliable to ensure long-term durability and reliable performance.\r\n\r\n### 𝗦𝗮𝗳𝗲𝘁𝘆 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝘀\r\n**Surge protection: Secure your electronics against voltage spikes by employing surge protection features on them. Sudden power surges do not damage electronics this way.\r\n\r\n**Overload Protection: A socket is designed to accommodate high power loads; in the unlikely event of an overload, however, its built-in protection mechanism will automatically switch off power in order to prevent damage and preserve itself.\r\n\r\n**Child Safety Shutters:** When living with children, built-in child safety shutters add an additional layer of protection, preventing foreign objects from accidentally inserting themselves into sockets and thus increasing safety.\r\n\r\n#𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘃𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗲𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗯𝗶𝗹𝗶𝘁𝘆 𝗔𝗿𝗲 𝗞𝗲𝘆 𝗔𝗱𝘃𝗮𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗴𝗲𝘀\r\n\r\n**Universal Compatibility: No matter if you use European, American, or Asian plugs - the universal socket design ensures compatibility across a range of plug types - making it the ideal solution for international travelers.\r\n\r\n**Compact and Portable: With its multifunctional capabilities, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket remains lightweight and portable enough for everyday use - perfect for professionals or frequent travelers on the go.\r\n\r\n**LED Indicator: For quick identification of active connections, sockets feature built-in LED indicators which offer visual indication when they are being used.\r\n\r\n### 𝗘𝗻𝘃𝗶𝗿𝗼𝗻𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘀𝗶𝗱𝗲𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀\r\n\r\n*Energy Efficient: Crafted to save energy and money, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket consumes minimal power when in standby mode, helping save on electric bills while lowering carbon footprint.\r\n\r\n**Eco-Friendly Materials: Construction materials used are recycled and eco-friendly in keeping with sustainable practices to minimize environmental impacts.\r\n\r\n### 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝗮𝘁𝗶𝘀𝗳𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻\r\n*Warranty and Support: STATA Imperial Multi Socket offers complete warranty coverage as well as access to dedicated customer support for peace of mind during purchase.\r\n\r\n**Easy Maintenance: Our design allows for effortless cleaning and upkeep, keeping our socket in peak condition with minimum effort required from you.\r\n\r\n### Intended Uses: For use at home and offices. These chargers are perfect for simultaneously charging multiple devices like smartphones, tablets, laptops and smart home devices. \r\nOffices: These adaptors are great for workspaces where multiple devices need to be charged at the same time.\r\nTravel: With its compact design and portable nature, this is a necessary travel gadget to keep all of your devices charged during travel. Events: Ideal for events where multiple attendees require charging their devices at once.\r\n\r\n𝗪𝗵𝘆 𝗰𝗵𝗼𝗼𝘀𝗲 𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗧𝗔 𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗮𝗹 𝗠𝘂𝗹𝘁𝗶 𝗦𝗼𝗰𝗸𝗲𝘁 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗧𝘆𝗽𝗲-𝗖 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗶𝘃𝗶𝘁𝘆?**\r\n\r\nStaying charged up is essential in today\'s digital world, and the STATA Imperial Multi Socket provides convenient, quick, and safe charging capabilities for devices in our lives. Its multifunctional capabilities meet all your power requirements - making this product an indispensable addition to your tech arsenal.\r\n\r\nSTATA Imperial Multi Socket With Type-C and USB is an innovative power solution. Boasting advanced features, user-friendly design, and durable construction, STATA makes a must-have choice for anyone seeking to streamline charging needs. Experience tomorrow\'s power solutions today by choosing STATA!','upload/products/thumbnail/1795388042406563.webp','Buy 5 Pin Multiple Socket With USB & Type-C port at lowest price','STATA offer 5 Pin Multi Socket with USB & Type-C port at Lowest price in Bangladesh. 10% Discount on First Purchase.',NULL,1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 07:32:19','2024-11-05 07:32:19'),(117,19,15,'Two & Three Pin Multi Socket','5-Pin Multi Socket with switch (Imperial Series)','STIM-ZBIT-TGS-5PINS','20000','Socket','Regular','White','490','340',NULL,'PC Virgin Resin,Fire Retardant.,All screws and connectors are of copper','Introduce the STATA Imperial 5-Pin Multi Socket with Switch for all your electrical needs! Built to maximize functionality while remaining safe for home, office, or industrial environments.\r\n\r\n𝗦𝗽𝗲𝗰𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻:\r\nInternational Standards\r\nDurable\r\nEfficient\r\nElegant Design\r\nGenerator Friendly\r\nVoltage: 250V AC\r\nCurrent: 16A\r\nFrequency: 50/60Hz\r\n\r\n### 𝗞𝗲𝘆 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝘀:\r\n**1. Five Universal Sockets: This multi-socket has five 5-pin universal sockets to accommodate different plug types for maximum adaptability across your devices and appliances.\r\n\r\n**2. Individual Switch Control: Each socket comes equipped with a separate switch for controlling power to each device independently. This feature also helps save electricity by powering down devices that are no longer in use and providing greater convenience and energy savings.\r\n\r\n**3. High-Quality Materials: Constructed using durable, top-grade materials, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket ensures long-term performance and safety. It features robust casing designed to withstand wear and tear over the years ahead, providing reliable service that lasts.\r\n\r\n** 4. Overload Protection: Safety is top-of-min