ice:\r\nSTATA LED Bulb aligns with the growing trend towards sustainability. By minimizing energy consumption, promoting longevity, and adhering to global efficiency standards, this LED bulb represents a conscious choice for environmentally responsible lighting solutions.\r\n\r\nSTATA LED Bulb (20W) goes beyond conventional lighting, embodying efficiency, longevity, and environmental consciousness. As businesses and households embrace energy-saving initiatives, this LED bulb emerges as a beacon of bright, sustainable illumination, ushering in a new era of lighting technology.\r\n\r\nSpecification:\r\nEfficacy: 100 Lumen/Watt\r\nBeam Angle: 270°\r\nPF : ≥ 0.50\r\nCRI : ≥80\r\nLifetime: 20,000 H\r\nFrequency: 50/60 Hz\r\nRated Voltage: 220V~240V\r\nVoltage range: 85 ~ 265V','upload/products/thumbnail/1795386411909695.webp','Best 18W LED BULB in Bangladesh','STATA 18W AC LED BULB','https://www.youtube.com/embed/V_1aaFjto8s?si=hQyPobJSc_pg7Fbb',1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-04-06 06:32:32','2024-04-06 06:32:32'),(127,19,18,'STATA LED Bracket Tube Light','STATA LED Bracket Tube Light','SBTWH40W','9999','LED TUBE LIGHT','4 Feet','40W','865','575',NULL,'40W,2 Years Warranty,4 Feet','In the realm of modern lighting solutions, the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light stands as a beacon of innovation and efficiency. Designed to provide unparalleled illumination while seamlessly blending with various interior décors, this lighting fixture is a testament to the perfect marriage of form and function. Whether you’re outfitting a commercial space, an office, or your home, the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light promises to deliver exceptional performance, energy savings, and aesthetic appeal.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Exceptional Illumination and Efficiency\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is its advanced LED technology, which ensures superior brightness and clarity. Unlike traditional fluorescent tube lights, LEDs provide instant illumination without flickering or warm-up time, making them ideal for environments where dependable lighting is crucial. With a color rendering index (CRI) of over 80, this tube light delivers natural and vibrant colors, enhancing the visual appeal of your surroundings and reducing eye strain.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is available in various color temperatures, ranging from a warm 2700K to a cool 6500K, allowing you to customize the lighting to suit different settings and moods. Whether you need a cozy, warm ambiance for a living room or a crisp, daylight-like environment for a workspace, this versatile lighting solution has you covered.\r\n\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is its energy efficiency. Consuming up to 70% less energy compared to conventional fluorescent tubes, this LED fixture significantly reduces electricity costs without compromising on brightness. This energy efficiency not only translates to cost savings but also contributes to environmental sustainability by reducing your carbon footprint.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Sleek Design and Versatility\r\n\r\nThe STATA LED Bracket Tube Light boasts a sleek, minimalist design that effortlessly complements modern interiors. Its slim profile and clean lines suitable to any space, whether mounted on the ceiling or wall. Qualitiful materials used for durability and longevity. Its\'s reliable lighting solution for years to come.\r\n\r\n\r\nOne of the key advantages of the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is its versatility. It is available in various lengths and wattages, catering to different lighting needs and room sizes. Whether you require a compact light for a small area or a longer tube to illuminate a larger space, there is a STATA LED Bracket Tube Light to fit your requirements. The fixture can be installed in a continuous row for a seamless look, making it perfect for offices, retail spaces, and other commercial settings.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Easy Installation and Maintenance\r\n\r\nInstalling the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is a straightforward process, thanks to its user-friendly design. The fixture comes with all necessary  hardware. With detail instruction manual, ensuring a hassle-free setup. The bracket system allows for secure attachment to various surfaces, providing stability and safety.\r\n\r\n\r\nMaintenance of the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is minimal, adding to its appeal as a practical lighting solution. The long lifespan of LED technology reduced maintenance costs. Additionally, the fixture is designed to resist dust and moisture, making it suitable for a wide range of environments, including kitchens and bathrooms.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Smart Lighting Features\r\n\r\nIn today’s connected world, smart lighting is becoming increasingly popular, and the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light is equipped to meet this demand. The fixture can be integrated with smart home systems, allowing you to control the lighting remotely via your smartphone or voice commands. Adjust the brightness, change the color temperature, or set schedules and timers to suit your lifestyle and preferences. These smart features enhance convenience and provide greater control over your lighting environment.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Safety and Environmental Considerations\r\n\r\nSafety is a top priority when it comes to lighting solutions, and the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light meets the highest standards. It is designed with built-in protection against electrical surges and overheating, ensuring safe operation even in demanding conditions. The absence of harmful substances like mercury, commonly found in fluorescent tubes, makes the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light an eco-friendly choice that contributes to a healthier living environment.\r\n\r\n\r\nFurthermore, the fixture is fully recyclable, reducing waste and supporting sustainable practices. By choosing the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light, you are making a responsible choice for both your space and the planet.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe STATA LED Bracket Tube Light represents the pinnacle of modern lighting solutions, combining exceptional performance, energy efficiency, and elegant design. Its versatile applications, ease of installation, and smart features make it a perfect choice for a wide range of settings, from homes and offices to commercial and industrial spaces. With the STATA LED Bracket Tube Light, you can transform your environment with high-quality, reliable illumination that enhances both functionality and aesthetic appeal. Embrace the future of lighting with STATA and experience the difference it makes in your daily life.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecification-\r\nEfficacy: ≥100\r\nPower Deviation: ±10%\r\nBeam Angle: 180°\r\nPF: ≥0.50\r\nLifetime: 20,000 H\r\nVoltage Range: 140-280V\r\nSurge Protection: ≥2.5kV','upload/products/thumbnail/1795386801563693.webp','Buy STATA LED Bracket Tube Light- Lowest price in Bangladesh','STATA IT LIMITED offers Best LED Tube Light in Bangladesh. 15% Discount ongoing for LED tube light. So get the offer & place your order.',NULL,1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-07-04 06:03:48','2024-07-04 06:03:48'),(128,19,15,'5 Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB','STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB','ST-SD-TSS-5PSC','100','Socket,5 Pin,Multi-socket,USB,Type-C,Fast Charging','Regular','Black,White','1800','1260',NULL,'USB,Type C Port,5-Pin','In the world of electrical solutions, having a reliable and versatile power socket is paramount. The STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB (Non-Smart) exemplifies seamless power distribution. This non-smart yet indispensable component plays a pivotal role in providing a safe and stable electricity supply to an array of devices and appliances. In this feature, we delve into the specifics of the MIB 5-Pin Multi Socket, emphasizing its design, functionality, and the benefits it brings to both households and businesses.\r\n\r\n𝐀𝐝𝐚𝐩𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫 𝐃𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐛𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nThe STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB is engineered to accommodate a wide range of plug types, making it a versatile solution for various devices, from appliances to electronic gadgets.\r\n\r\n𝐃𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nCrafted with precision engineering, the socket boasts a robust build designed to withstand continuous usage over extended periods. High-quality materials ensure long-lasting product life. \r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐞 𝐄𝐥𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬:\r\nThe multi-pin design of the socket ensures a secure and stable connection with plugs, minimizing the risk of loose connections or power interruptions. This is crucial for maintaining a steady flow of electricity.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐚𝐟𝐞𝐭𝐲 𝐅𝐢𝐫𝐬𝐭:\r\nSafety is paramount, and this socket is equipped with protective measures to prevent electrical overloads, short circuits, and other potential hazards. This ensures a safe operating environment for users.\r\n\r\n𝐔𝐧𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐚𝐥 𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲:\r\nWhether in residential spaces, commercial establishments, or industrial settings, this socket is versatile enough to meet the power needs of diverse environments.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐝 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐜𝐞𝐬𝐬:\r\nDesigned for straightforward installation, the STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB is accessible to both professionals and DIY enthusiasts. Clear instructions and user-friendly features simplify the process.\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐈𝐧𝐝𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐲 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬:\r\nThe socket adheres to industry-specific standards and certifications, ensuring that it meets the highest quality and safety benchmarks.\r\n\r\n𝐂𝐨𝐬𝐭-𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐒𝐨𝐥𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nInvesting in the STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB translates to a cost-effective solution for ensuring reliable power distribution. \r\n\r\n𝐒𝐥𝐞𝐞𝐤 𝐀𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nApart from its functionality, the socket is designed with aesthetics in mind. Its clean and minimalist appearance allows it to seamlessly blend into various interior designs.\r\n\r\n𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐲:\r\nThe socket\'s design facilitates efficient power distribution, ensuring that connected devices receive a consistent and reliable supply of electricity without voltage fluctuations.\r\n\r\nSTATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB (Non-Smart) is a fundamental component of any electrical system. The durability, safety features, and effective power distribution of this product make it essential, for both homes and businesses. It seamlessly integrates with devices and appliances providing a foundation, for powering them. Embrace the assurance of a stable and secure electricity supply with the STATA 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB','upload/products/thumbnail/1815045514599641.png','5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB Price in Bangladesh','We are offering high quality 5-Pin Multi-Socket with Type-C & USB series at lowest price with 1 year free replacement warranty & 5 years service warranty.',NULL,1,1,1,NULL,1,'2024-11-07 15:23:05','2024-11-07 15:23:05'),(129,19,15,'STATA 5-PIN Socket With Neon (Full Glass)','STATA 5-Pin Socket With Neon (Full Glass)','ST-5PS-FG-N','19','Socket,5 Pin with Neon','Regular','Black','1800','1260','540','Glass Panel 5-Pin,With Neon,Crystal Glass Panel,Universal Port','STATA 5-PIN Socket With Neon (Full Glass)\r\n\r\n𝐀𝐝𝐚𝐩𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫 𝐃𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐛𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nThe STATA 5-PIN Socket With Neon (Full Glass) is engineered to accommodate a wide range of plug types, making it a versatile solution for various devices, from appliances to electronic gadgets.\r\n\r\n𝐃𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\r\nCrafted with precision engineering, the socket boasts a robust build designed to withstand continuous usage over extended periods. High-quality materials ensure long-lasting product life. \r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐞 𝐄𝐥𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬:\r\nThe multi-pin design of the socket ensures a secure and stable connection with plugs, minimizing the risk of loose connections or power interruptions. This is crucial for maintaining a steady flow of electricity.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐚𝐟𝐞𝐭𝐲 𝐅𝐢𝐫𝐬𝐭:\r\nSafety is paramount, and this socket is equipped with protective measures to prevent electrical overloads, short circuits, and other potential hazards. This ensures a safe operating envir