e and feature-rich 𝐍𝐞𝐭+Telephone  Sockets.\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐞𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-\r\n𝐏𝐚𝐧𝐞𝐥: Crystal glass panel, no fading, elegant and stylish \r\n\r\n𝐖𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐨𝐟: Yes\r\n\r\n𝐀𝐧𝐭𝐢-𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐠: Yes\r\n\r\n𝐕𝐨𝐥𝐭𝐚𝐠𝐞: 170V-240V \r\n\r\n𝐋𝐨𝐚𝐝 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫: 5-300W/Gang \r\n\r\n𝐂𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: CE, FCC, RoHS\r\n\r\n𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞: -20-70 Degree\r\n\r\n𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 & 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲-\r\n1 Year Free Replacement & 5 Years Service Warranty','upload/products/thumbnail/1815049870082201.png','Net+Telephone Socket Price in Bangladesh','Find the best prices for Net+Telephone Sockets in Bangladesh. Explore a wide range of options for seamless entertainment and internet connectivity at affordable rates. Upgrade your home experience. Discover competitive prices now!','https://www.youtube.com/embed/hxFS2A6XlVQ',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-11-07 15:04:11','2024-11-07 15:04:11'),(131,19,15,'Imperial Series Trail Kit Package','Imperial Series Trail Kit Package','ST-IMP-TKP','11110','Switch','Regular','White','1615','1130','485','100% Copper,PC Material','Introduce the STATA Imperial Series Trail Kit Package  for all your electrical needs! Built to maximize functionality while remaining safe for home, office, or industrial environments.\r\n\r\n𝗦𝗽𝗲𝗰𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻:\r\nInternational Standards\r\nDurable\r\nEfficient\r\nElegant Design\r\nGenerator Friendly\r\nVoltage: 250V AC\r\nCurrent: 16A\r\nFrequency: 50/60Hz\r\n\r\n### 𝗞𝗲𝘆 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝘀:\r\n**1. Five Universal Sockets: This multi-socket has five 5-pin universal sockets to accommodate different plug types for maximum adaptability across your devices and appliances.\r\n\r\n**2. Individual Switch Control: Each socket comes equipped with a separate switch for controlling power to each device independently. This feature also helps save electricity by powering down devices that are no longer in use and providing greater convenience and energy savings.\r\n\r\n**3. High-Quality Materials: Constructed using durable, top-grade materials, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket ensures long-term performance and safety. It features robust casing designed to withstand wear and tear over the years ahead, providing reliable service that lasts.\r\n\r\n** 4. Overload Protection: Safety is top-of-mind with the STATA Imperial Multi Socket, featuring built-in overload protection to safeguard devices against surges or short circuits that might occur from power surges and spikes.\r\n\r\n### *5. Space-Saving Design: With its space-saving, compact design, this multi-socket can easily fit on a desk, wall mount, or corner without taking up too much room.\r\n\r\n**6. LED Indicator Lights:** Each switch features an LED indicator light to quickly identify active sockets - providing extra convenience, especially in low light conditions.\r\n\r\n### **7. Multifunctional Applications: From powering home theater equipment and office computers to kitchen appliances and industrial tools, the STATA Imperial Multi Socket can accommodate various uses across various settings.\r\n\r\n### Why choose STATA Imperial 5-Pin Multi Socket with Switch?\r\n\r\n- Versatility: Compatible with an extensive array of plug types and suitable for various devices.\r\n- Convenience: Individual switches per socket provide easy control and energy savings while safety protections built-in ensure the protection of devices connected to this surge protector.\r\n- Durability: Composed from high-grade materials for long-lasting use. Space Saving Design: Our compact design fits seamlessly into any environment.\r\n\r\nElevate your power management system with the STATA Imperial 5-Pin Multi Socket with Switch. Perfect for streamlining workspace, improving home setup, or protecting electrical devices - this multi-socket offers efficient yet safe power distribution for efficient and safe power usage.','upload/products/thumbnail/1815768302458496.png','STATA Imperial Series Trail Kit Package','STATA Imperial Series Trail Kit Package',NULL,NULL,1,1,'1',1,'2024-11-15 06:19:55',NULL);
